  "field": "Spatial and single-cell genomics",
  "summary": "Andrea Rivas-Keller develops computational methods for reconstructing tissue architecture from multiplexed imaging and single-cell sequencing data, with a recurring emphasis on graph-based domain discovery and honest uncertainty reporting in spatial statistics.",
