    "Unsupervised graph-based tissue domain discovery from multiplexed spatial proteomics",
    "Imaging mass cytometry (IMC) panel design, segmentation, and single-cell quantification",
    "Spatial statistics for cell-cell neighborhood enrichment with honest null models",
    "Scalable whole-slide image processing pipelines for multiplexed tissue imaging",
    "Integration of spatial transcriptomics with protein-level imaging assays"
  ],
